  "system": {
    "description": "<p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">Greatsword that a Being must Bind themselves to to access its Powers, which are as follows:</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Haste: (1/Day) For 1 Minute, the Wielder's Speed is doubled, they gain Favor on Reflex Saves, and can take a second Action each Round.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Lifesteal: Killing a foe with it heals the Wielder for [[/r 4d8#Voidedge]] HP. If the slain foe is an Artificial or Undead Being, it instead deals [[/r 4d8#Voidedge]] damage to the Wielder.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Resolve: The Wielder is Immune to Charmed and Frightened.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Sense Life: Detects Small and larger living Beings within Far.</span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\">• Soul Eater: It devours the soul of foes it slays. Those who have their soul eaten can't be resurrected unless a wish is granted to do so.</span></p>",
